      his or her own behalf. section 3. routine uses. to initiate the processing of
      a personnel action being requested by the soldier. disclosure. voluntary. failure
      to provide social security number may result in a delay or error in processing
      of the request for personnel action. at the top of the form there are 4 labels
      stating copy 1, copy 2, copy 3, and copy 4. the label above these states. circle
      the appropriate copy designator. field 1. thru. include zip code. enter text.
